 "scope": "Exact algebra and a production-field execution of a METERED step rule: every step charges its actual row to a running meter and the run aborts at the cap, so total work <= 2^125.73 holds by construction on every run.  The abort probability is bounded by Hoeffding on the branch bits under H2 and debited from the success probability. The DP collision-detection procedure is specified and its store is itemised; the collision law's no-merge property is demoted to a scoped heuristic with the shifted-image channel measured.  H1' (random-mapping walk) and H2 (trace-bit pseudorandomness) remain heuristics.",
